config.inputField.setAttribute("aria-activedescendant", list[currentFocus].dataset.value);

They set to dataset.value (which is the item's value, e.g., "Market Street").

Should be list[currentFocus].id (or maybe the element's id attribute). The Item component sets id: `${config.resultItem.className}_${index}`. For resultItem.className = "autoCompleteJS_result". So IDs would be "autoCompleteJS_result_0", etc.

Thus fix: change to list[currentFocus].id.

Let's verify other parts: They also set aria-selected attribute correctly via list[currentFocus].setAttribute("aria-selected", "true"); Good.

